  logNum: 3
  log:
  - This area seems to have some strange rules.
  - 'Rule no.1:

    After standing on a pink pad you must stand on 2 blue pads.'
  - 'Rule no.2:

    every other pad must be a pad with a number on it.'
  - 'Rule no.3:

    If a pad has a number it must be equal to the number of previous'
  - pads stood on.
  summary: Strange Platforms
